# Byte-exact content must not go through end-of-line conversion.
#
# SPI NOR images are compared with the SHA-256 values in SHA256SUMS and
# manifest.json, and the license texts under licenses/ are kept verbatim --
# licenses/README.md records their SHA-256 values and states that the original
# texts are preserved unmodified. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# would rewrite their line endings and break both claims.
*.img -text
02_Firmware/Linux-Buildroot/** -text
